:\"LiquidGEMM_ Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\",\"score\":178.49156979790195,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":72},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":166},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":453},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1557},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1624}],\"excerpt\":\"## LiquidGEMM: Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是LiquidServe——基于LiquidGEMM W4A8 GEMM kernel构建的端到端LLM serving系统。LiquidServe集成了：(1) FlashAttention-2用于runtime attention计算；(2) PagedAttention用于KV cache管理；(3) SmoothQuant per-token动态激活量化（FP16→INT8）；(4) KV cache per-channel静态INT8量化（scale factor离线计算）；(5) 权重离线两级…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving\",\"score\":160.50031147793013,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"llm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":80},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1103},{\"match\":\"TensorRT\",\"offset\":1878},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1890}],\"excerpt\":\"## D2MoE: Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是 D2MoE 的在线执行引擎，包含三个核心 Serving 调度组件：(1) **Bit-Width-Aware I/O-Compute Pipeline**：将传统\\\"按 expert ID 顺序执行 I/O+Compute\\\"改为按 fine-grained bit-width 级重新排序（Figure 9d），利用 MWQ 嵌套结构使低 bit-width 权重可被多个请求复用，减少 I/O 等待时间。(2) **Hottest-Expert-Bit-First (HEBF) 调度算法**：为每个 e…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/BLASST Dynamic BLocked Attention Sparsity via Softmax Thresholding.md\",\"basename\":\"BLASST Dynamic BLocked Attention Sparsity via Softmax Thresholding\",\"score\":46.95628219388496,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm和flashinfer中集成的blasst\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llm和flashinfer中集成的blasst\"],\"matches\"