{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_03_PrYuwUaUHEOK8DPJeucv2723","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/Fast-dLLM_ Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding.md\",\"basename\":\"Fast-dLLM_ Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding\",\"score\":233.19179619373517,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llm吞吐量54\",\"llm使用full\",\"llm推理**。核心设计：\",\"llm推理\",\"llm（llada、dream）使用基于τ-leaping近似的掩码扩散模型进行序列生成。在推理时，模型从全\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":54},{\"match\":\"LLM（LLaDA、Dream）使用基于τ-leaping近似的掩码扩散模型进行序列生成。在推理时，模型从全\",\"offset\":199},{\"match\":\"LLM使用full\",\"offset\":479},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":907},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":911},{\"match\":\"st-\",\"offset\":1694},{\"match\":\"ion LLM推理**。核\",\"offset\":1793},{\"match\":\"st-\",\"offset\":2046},{\"match\":\"st-\",\"offset\":2475},{\"match\":\"定义硬件。Fas\",\"offset\":2852}],\"excerpt\":\"## Fast-dLLM: Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  **Vanilla Masked Diffusion Model (MDM) with τ-leaping 独立并行解码**：当前开源的Diffusion LLM（LLaDA、Dream）使用基于τ-leaping近似的掩码扩散模型进行序列生成。在推理时，模型从全[MASK]序列开始，通过多步迭代逐步将[MASK]token替换为真实token。默认最优策略是每步解码1个t…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/AdaServe_ Accelerating Multi-SLO LLM Serving with SLO-Customized Speculative Decoding.md\",\"basename\":\"AdaServe_ Accelerating Multi-SLO LLM Serving with SLO-Customized Speculative Decoding\",\"score\":196.3335436793395,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llm默认cuda\",\"llm-spec和spec\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":120},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":157},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":161},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":926},{\"match\":\"LLM-Spec和Spec\",\"offset\":1005},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1194},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1456},{\"match\":\"LLM默认CUDA\",\"offset\":1673},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2086},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2849},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":3557}],\"excerpt\":\"## AdaServe: Accelerating Multi-SLO LLM Serving with SLO-Customized Speculative Decoding\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  Baseline是现有LLM serving系统的continuous batching策略（vLLM、TensorRT-LLM、Sarathi-Serve），将同一batch中所有请求同质化处理，iteration-level scheduling导致batch内各请求per-token latency近似一致。\\n==continuous batch、iteration-level==\\n```\\n\\t## step结尾补充batch\\n\\tfor each…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/UniQL_ Unified Quantization and Low-rank Compression for Adaptive Edge LLMs.md\",\"basename\":\"UniQL_ Unified Quantization and Low-rank Compression for Adaptive Edge LLMs\",\"score\":97.25819784393512,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-model-optimizer中的awq实现\",\"llm\",\"llms\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLMs\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":151},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":389},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-Model-Optimizer中的AWQ实现\",\"offset\":501}],\"excerpt\":\"## UniQL: Unified Quantization and Low-rank Compression for Adaptive Edge LLMs\\n- baseline方法是什么？\\n  **Baseline 1（结构化剪枝）**：MoDeGPT（Lin et al., 2025）和SVD-LLM（Wang et al., 2025b）。\\n  - MoDeGPT：使用伪逆（Moore-Penrose inverse）在FP64精度下对MLP中间激活的通道相关性矩阵求解，排序权重通道以最小化剪枝误差。每个剪枝率需要重新计算伪逆（因为(W')^† ≠ (W^†)'），复杂度O(n³)，在Llama-3.1-8B的D_int=14336矩阵上伪逆耗时20.58分钟。对Qwen-2.5-7B（D_int=18944）因病态条件矩阵导致严…\"},{\"filename\":\"idea_notes/BLASST Dynamic BLocked Attention Sparsity via Softmax Thresholding.md\",\"basename\":\"BLASST Dynamic BLocked Attention Sparsity via Softmax Thresholding\",\"score\":58.78044760192913,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm的graph\",\"tensorrt-llm或flashinfer调用flashattention-3\",\"llm或flashinfer调用flashattention\",\"llm和flashinfer的attention接口中\",\"llm的graph\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"：TensorRT-LLM或FlashInfer调用FlashAttention-\",\"offset\":508},{\"match\":\"。TensorRT-L