{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02_ZBqKYwPEURkBPltRLSDo6185","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/AI Agent Serving System（AI Agent服务系统）.md\",\"basename\":\"AI Agent Serving System（AI Agent服务系统）\",\"score\":1799.7328175376358,\"foundWords\":[\"sglang提供continuous\",\"serving\",\"serving峰值throughput远低于share\",\"serving峰值throughput远低于sharegpt（react\",\"serving峰值throughput远低于sharegpt\",\"serving中模型选择固定在部署时不同，aims在每次llm\",\"serving中模型选择固定在部署时不同\",\"serving系统通常：\",\"serving系统通常\",\"serving系统需要处理：\",\"serving系统需要处理\",\"serving（单次llm\",\"framework\",\"inference\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":12},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"serving（单次LLM\",\"offset\":154},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":168},{\"match\":\"serving系统需要处理：\",\"offset\":199},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":424},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":493},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":1000},{\"match\":\"serving峰值throughput远低于ShareGPT（ReAct\",\"offset\":2218},{\"match\":\"serving系统通常：\",\"offset\":2363},{\"match\":\"SGLang提供continuous\",\"offset\":2471},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":2767},{\"match\":\"serving中模型选择固定在部署时不同，AIMS在每次LLM\",\"offset\":2959},{\"match\":\"Framework\",\"offset\":3324}],\"excerpt\":\"## AI Agent Serving System（AI Agent服务系统）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAI Agent Serving System是专门为AI agent workload（多轮LLM推理+外部工具调用的动态推理）设计的在线服务基础设施。与传统的chatbot serving（单次LLM inference per request）不同，agent serving系统需要处理：(1) 每请求多次LLM call和tool call的交替迭代；(2) tool等待期间GPU idle的不规则资源利用；(3) 多轮交互积累的长context导致的KV cache膨胀；(4)…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM (Block-level + Sub-block Cache).md\",\"basename\":\"Hierarchical Caching for Block Diffusion LLM (Block-level + Sub-block Cache)\",\"score\":322.00527165967975,\"foundWords\":[\"sglang\",\"serving\",\"serving系统中的位置和运转流程：\",\"serving系统中的位置和运转流程\",\"